# Design System

## Brand
- Product name: `dqt` — always lowercase.
- Wordmark: JetBrains Mono, weight 300, `-0.05em` tracking.
- Dark theme is the default and primary design target. Light is supported.

## UI philosophy
- **Dense power-user UI.** No decorative whitespace. Information density is a feature.
- **Zero border-radius.** Sharp corners everywhere. No `rounded-*` classes. No `border-radius` in CSS.
- **1px borders.** Always 1px, never thicker. Color from `line` token.
- **No drop shadows.** Only the status-dot halo (`box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(...)`).
- **Monospace for data.** JetBrains Mono for all numeric values, statistical scores, IDs, code.

## Color semantic tokens
| Token | Light | Dark | Use |
|---|---|---|---|
| `accent` | `#9DD0B0` | same | Primary action, active states |
| `pass` | `#7FB394` | `#5A8F70` | Passing verdict |
| `warn` | `#D9B566` | `#B89540` | Warning verdict |
| `fail` | `#E07B6E` | `#C25D52` | Failing verdict |
| `fail-bg` | `rgba(224,123,110,0.07)` | same | Row highlight for failing items |

## Motion
- 220ms `fadeIn` on screen mount (slide-in from 2px offset).
- 240ms ease-out on bar widths (StatGauge fill animation).
- No other animations. No bounce, no spring, no decorative transitions.

## Icons
lucide-react, stroke-width 1.6. Never filled icons. Size 14–16px for inline, 18px for actions.

## Status dot
8px circle + 2px halo at 18–22% opacity. Colors from pass/warn/fail tokens.

## AppShell
212px collapsible sidebar + topbar. Topbar: search trigger (Cmd-K), theme toggle, user menu.

Sidebar groups:
- **Warehouse**: Sources, Datasets, Lineage
- **Semantic layer**: Metrics, Causality
- **Watch**: Incidents, Tests
- **Govern**: Catalog, Policies, Audit
- **Team**: On-call, Tasks

Active state: left 2px accent border + `bg-1` tint.

Sidebar footer: current on-call ("Jamie Lin · on-call · ends 18:30").

## Tooltips
6px gap above target, `bg-1` surface, 1px border from `line` token.

## shadcn/ui overrides
All `Card` components: `className="rounded-none"`. All `Button` + `Badge` components have `accent`, `pass`, `warn`, `fail` variants registered.
